#: package/contents/ui/main.qml:828
msgid ""
"Drag a box on the empty desktop to make a fence. Each fence can collect "
"files by type, name, site or date: new documents, photos or archives find "
"their own place. Your files stay in the Desktop folder; fences only group "
"them."
